flowchart TD
    A[Policy Violation Detected] --> B{Severity}

    B -->|Low| C[Record Warning]
    B -->|Moderate| D[Pause Affected Action]
    B -->|High| E[Stop Harness Run]
    B -->|Critical| F[Stop + Preserve Evidence + Escalate]

    C --> G[Audit]
    D --> G
    E --> G
    F --> G

    D --> H[Authorized Review]
    E --> H
    F --> H
